{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>1Contact Pro 是一款強大的通訊錄管理應用，專為需要整理、清理及備份聯絡人的用戶設計。它結合了人工智能技術與直觀工具，協助個人及商務專業人士高效維護地址簿數據。目前該 App 在 App Store 提供限時免費下載，機會難得。</p>\n\n<h2>AI 驅動智能清理備份</h2>\n<p>此應用利用 AI 自動偵測並合併重複聯絡人，支持姓名、電話或電郵的多維度匹配。用戶可一鍵移除不完整資料，並透過 iCloud 等雲端服務進行安全備份。此外，內置 OCR 掃描名片功能與批量分享選項，大幅優化管理效率，確保重要聯繫方式隨時可用且井井有條。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-48-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-49-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-50-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-51-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-52-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-53-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：1Contact Pro: Clean &amp; Backup</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T02:38:27.585556+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}